# ☁️ AWS EC2 + RDS PHP Connection Lab — Complete Beginner Friendly Guide

Your lab goal is:

✅ Create a MySQL database in AWS RDS
✅ Create an EC2 Ubuntu server
✅ Connect EC2 to RDS
✅ Install Apache + PHP + MySQL client
✅ Run PHP code from EC2 and retrieve data from RDS database

I’ll explain everything from zero level 👨‍💻✨

---

# 🔥 Architecture (What We Are Building)

```text
Your Browser
      ↓
EC2 Ubuntu Server (Web Server + PHP)
      ↓
RDS MySQL Database
```

* EC2 = Virtual Computer in cloud
* Apache = Web server
* PHP = Backend language
* RDS = Managed MySQL database

