# 🚀 PART 3 — Connect to EC2

---

# Windows (Git Bash / PowerShell)

Move `.pem` file to Downloads/Desktop.

Open terminal there.

Run:

```bash
chmod 400 mykey.pem
```

Now connect:

```bash
ssh -i mykey.pem ubuntu@YOUR_PUBLIC_IP
```

Example:

```bash
ssh -i mykey.pem ubuntu@43.204.xx.xx
```

Type:

```text
yes
```

🎉 You are now inside Ubuntu EC2 server.

