## 1. What is EC2?

Virtual server in AWS cloud.

---

## 2. What is RDS?

Managed relational database service.

---

## 3. Why use Security Groups?

To control inbound and outbound traffic.

---

## 4. Why connect EC2 to RDS?

Web application hosted on EC2 accesses database stored in RDS.

